    "turn_text": "And I wonder why that is, is it because we're seeing more, and I don't want to use the word extreme, maybe more ideologically driven groups coming from the left, or is it this issue where there's a big controversy over whether climate change is man-made versus you know, this is going to happen anyway, you know, evolutionary. Because I just don't understand it. What was like green jobs and technology, clean energy technology, sort of becoming a boon industry and as a potential to be",
