    "turn_idx": 35,
    "turn_text": "I think a lot of Republicans have become captured by a very rigid ideology around things like denying climate, the human role in climate change and this expansive view of the Second Amendment which would impede any kind of reform at all about the dealing with handguns and rifles and all that kind of stuff.",
