    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/0/50995.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 37,
    "turn_text": "Well, I think some of them get it intellectually that the young people, I've given them a lot of polling and they get that the young people feel certain ways and that we need to reach out to more voters. but they just can't make the ideological jump. And you've heard of stuff that's set on the House floor about the environment and guns and all that kind of stuff. It's pretty rigid ideologies there. And some of the ones on the left go too far.",
