    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/0/50995.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 38,
    "turn_text": "Well, that's what I mean. It sort of seems like both parties, and again, this is both parties and the ideological extremes, if you will, they do become very rigid in their opinions of things. And it almost feels like even if they let up just a little bit, that somehow that issue will be taken away from them. I was talking to Dave Schweiker the other day who was talking to me about all this new technology for clean energy and how he was talking to some Democrats about this and they were getting very sort of possessive of it. Like, wait, no, that's our issue.",
