        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "The Founders did not mention term limits in the Constitution.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The author has introduced a bill to cut off congressional pay after 12 years of service.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
